# `project-away` lexes as three tokens; the parser joins them (D-026).
mode: syntax
---- query
t | project-away x | project - away y
---- expected
IDENT@0..1 "t"
WHITESPACE@1..2 " "
PIPE@2..3 "|"
WHITESPACE@3..4 " "
IDENT@4..11 "project"
MINUS@11..12 "-"
IDENT@12..16 "away"
WHITESPACE@16..17 " "
IDENT@17..18 "x"
WHITESPACE@18..19 " "
PIPE@19..20 "|"
WHITESPACE@20..21 " "
IDENT@21..28 "project"
WHITESPACE@28..29 " "
MINUS@29..30 "-"
WHITESPACE@30..31 " "
IDENT@31..35 "away"
WHITESPACE@35..36 " "
IDENT@36..37 "y"
WHITESPACE@37..38 "\n"
